function markerScreen(){$('main').innerHTML=pageTop('Tracking markers','Tools')+selectField('markerStyle','Style',[['cross','Cross'],['circle','Circle'],['checker','Checker']],'cross','onchange="markerPreview()"')+selectField('markerSize','Physical size',[['25','25 mm'],['50','50 mm'],['100','100 mm'],['200','200 mm']],'50','onchange="markerPreview()"')+selectField('markerPaper','Paper',paperOptions,'A4')+selectField('markerCount','Count',['1','4','8','12'],'4')+'<div class="preview-wrap" id="markerPreview"></div><p class="helper">Print at 100% / actual size. Disable fit-to-page. IDs are reserved when you prepare a sheet.</p><button class="primary action" onclick="printMarkers()">Print / Save PDF</button>';markerPreview()}
